    "Reason : 1 - The proposed cycle shed by virtue of its size, design and appearance would appear incongruous and out of place in the front garden and therefore fail to respect the character and appearance of the existing front boundary and garden of the host building and conservation area. As such, the development is considered contrary to the requirements of Policy D1 (Design) and Policy D2 (Heritage) of the Camden Local Plan 2017 and Policy DH1 (Design) and DH2 (Conservation Area) of the Hampstead Neighbourhood Plan 2025."
